What more is there to be said?


00:18:37.848 --> 00:18:38.915
Jeez...


00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.790
This is disgusting.


00:18:47.592 --> 00:18:49.492
Jesus, that was heavier
than I thought.


00:18:49.494 --> 00:18:51.528
- Yeah.
- Dead bodies always are.


00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:54.365
Hey, Babe?
Can you grab my carry-on?


00:18:55.267 --> 00:18:57.603
I'm not gonna wander around the
desert dressed like this.


00:18:59.905 --> 00:19:02.206
Probably have something for you,
if you want.


00:19:02.908 --> 00:19:04.774
I like what I'm wearing.


00:19:04.776 --> 00:19:06.276
What about your heels?


00:19:06.278 --> 00:19:08.548
I like how they make my legs look.


00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.616
Hallelujah to that.


00:19:28.799 --> 00:19:31.199
There's gotta be a map in
here somewhere.


00:19:40.412 --> 00:19:42.613
Like it's not hot enough
out here already.


00:19:43.615 --> 00:19:45.015
Find anything?


00:19:45.717 --> 00:19:47.784
Ah, no. No. Not yet.


00:19:58.763 --> 00:20:00.630
I'd kill for an aspirin right now.


00:20:00.732 --> 00:20:02.732
Well how about one of these?


00:20:02.934 --> 00:20:05.068
Ohh, Vicodin.


00:20:05.893 --> 00:20:06.869
Where did you get those?


00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:09.674
Underneath the seat
where your hubby was sitting.


00:20:10.976 --> 00:20:14.311
Where the hell would I get
something like that from?


00:20:14.913 --> 00:20:15.879
Relax.


00:20:15.881 --> 00:20:20.617
I'm pulling your leg, man.
We can all thank Lizzy.


00:20:20.719 --> 00:20:25.589
Yeah. Lizzy. My assistant.
She borrowed the car.


00:20:26.091 --> 00:20:28.858
That woman has a brutal memory
but a great ass.


00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:29.993
Hey.


00:20:30.495 --> 00:20:32.395
Look, that was a long time
ago, Babe.


00:20:32.397 --> 00:20:33.397
All right, down the hatch.


00:20:33.498 --> 00:20:36.236
That's okay.
We all have a past.


00:20:39.738 --> 00:20:40.486
Wanna play?


00:20:49.681 --> 00:20:53.383
They're just painkillers.
We've got a long way ahead of us.


00:20:53.685 --> 00:20:54.987
Let's go.


00:20:57.989 --> 00:20:59.289
Saddle up!


00:21:00.091 --> 00:21:02.191
I can't believe you've
been holding this whole time.


00:21:02.193 --> 00:21:03.526
Yeah, now we be sharing.


00:21:03.528 --> 00:21:05.129
I'm sorry I doubted you.


00:21:06.131 --> 00:21:08.402
Forget it. Come on.


00:21:12.704 --> 00:21:14.771
BILLY Come on, slow pokes.


00:21:48.839 --> 00:21:49.939
Whooo!


00:21:53.778 --> 00:21:57.217
Roy, come on, man.
That is some good shit.


00:22:00.619 --> 00:22:01.567
Oh fuck it.


00:22:08.793 --> 00:22:12.597
We just survived a car crash, saw a
woman die right in front of us, and...


00:22:14.399 --> 00:22:16.365
we're stuck in the middle
of the fucking desert.


00:22:16.367 --> 00:22:17.801
Why don't you cut me some slack?


00:22:17.903 --> 00:22:19.168
I know, but after everything...


00:22:19.170 --> 00:22:19.937
I can handle it.


00:22:20.639 --> 00:22:22.171
All right, Jamie.
Have a hit.


00:22:22.173 --> 00:22:23.873
Don't push your luck, Billy.


00:22:23.975 --> 00:22:29.646
You know, it might be in all our best
interests if we just try to remain mellow.


00:22:29.648 --> 00:22:30.613
Is that so?


00:22:30.815 --> 00:22:32.015
It's a proven fact.


00:22:32.017 --> 00:22:35.118
People do crazy shit in the desert.


00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:39.088
Taking in all this vast expanse,
you mix in it with


00:22:39.090 --> 00:22:41.924
some sun stroke, and voila la!


00:22:41.926 --> 00:22:44.594
You got yourself a
bad batch of juju.


00:22:44.896 --> 00:22:47.997
Yeah, we get scripts sent to us
all the time about this shit.


00:22:47.999 --> 00:22:49.433
You mean movies?


00:22:50.235 --> 00:22:54.805
Like I could turn psycho
and drink all your blood?


00:22:55.907 --> 00:23:01.175
- Ahhh... Jesus... vampire!
- Get off... Ahhh!


00:23:04.882 --> 00:23:07.884
You know, I guess we should be
happy we're still alive.


00:23:08.286 --> 00:23:10.654
Yeah, we should.


00:23:10.956 --> 00:23:12.222
And you know what...?


00:23:13.224 --> 00:23:15.895
The highway's gonna show up
before we even know it.


00:23:19.297 --> 00:23:21.633
Then why don't you
give me a ride.


00:23:23.835 --> 00:23:25.602
Go get them. Haha!


00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.808
Whooo!


00:23:56.266 --> 00:23:58.766
I didn't spill my drink.


00:24:06.177 --> 00:24:08.244
I say we just keep walking to Vegas.


00:24:08.246 --> 00:24:10.814
Well aren't you awful
horny to get there.


00:24:11.316 --> 00:24:12.917
Fuck, yeah, aren't you?


00:24:14.019 --> 00:24:18.488
Tell you the truth, baby, everything
to me is a little hazy right now.


00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:21.492
Hey, you did propose.


00:24:23.094 --> 00:24:27.797
I witnessed it.
You're a hell of a romantic, Billy.


00:24:27.899 --> 00:24:31.570
Come on. Can't a guy get a
fucking break around here.


00:24:33.872 --> 00:24:36.573
Come on, I'm joking. Ok?


00:24:36.875 --> 00:24:38.574
Who wouldn't want to marry this face...


00:24:38.576 --> 00:24:42.176
and those gorgeous,
wrap-around legs.


00:24:48.186 --> 00:24:53.457
Let's go to Vegas! I promise,
you will not regret it.


00:24:54.059 --> 00:24:55.929
You are killing me, woman.


00:24:59.831 --> 00:25:01.833
I know what the blue ones are for.


00:25:03.835 --> 00:25:05.069
I just don't need them.


00:25:06.771 --> 00:25:07.804
Whooo!


00:25:07.806 --> 00:25:09.906
Vegas! Whooo!


00:25:13.044 --> 00:25:14.444
Gimme that ass!


00:25:15.246 --> 00:25:17.313
Hahaha!


00:25:22.286 --> 00:25:23.753
Come on! Let's go!


00:25:23.755 --> 00:25:25.822
Come on, slow pokes!


00:25:33.664 --> 00:25:35.633
Shouldn't we see something by now?


00:25:36.835 --> 00:25:37.968
We will.


00:25:39.170 --> 00:25:40.406
What is it?


00:25:43.308 --> 00:25:44.775
Just, ah...


00:25:45.777 --> 00:25:47.009
I'm just...


00:25:47.011 --> 00:25:48.779
Fuck, I'm hot!


00:25:49.781 --> 00:25:52.982
That's not nothing.
You're cut. Deep.


00:25:53.084 --> 00:25:55.985
Broken bottle of tequila.
Doesn't matter.


00:25:56.187 --> 00:25:59.856
Holy Fuck. You look like
one of them freaks from Oz.


00:25:59.858 --> 00:26:02.692
You know Billy, he's hurt.
Just leave him alone.


00:26:02.894 --> 00:26:04.861
Let me take a look.


00:26:04.863 --> 00:26:06.796
I'm fine.


00:26:06.798 --> 00:26:07.897
Look, Billy...


00:26:07.899 --> 00:26:11.735
I've done my time.
And it's done. Ok?


00:26:12.937 --> 00:26:13.938
It's done.


00:26:15.240 --> 00:26:17.173
- Babe, come on.
- You need to rest.


00:26:17.175 --> 00:26:19.241
Yeah, come on, bro.
Look, you're bleeding like hell.


00:26:19.243 --> 00:26:22.913
- Look. I'm fine. Ok?
- You see this?


00:26:23.715 --> 00:26:25.047
That will take care of it.


00:26:25.049 --> 00:26:27.917
All right.
We just need to keep moving.


00:26:27.919 --> 00:26:29.085
You can't keep taking those.


00:26:29.087 --> 00:26:30.686
Let him take two if it'll help.


00:26:30.688 --> 00:26:31.654
It's not your business.


00:26:31.656 --> 00:26:35.626
Enough! Ok? We're moving.


00:26:37.028 --> 00:26:38.296
Now!


00:26:40.498 --> 00:26:41.342
Come on!


00:26:48.973 --> 00:26:50.940
What do you think he did?


00:26:50.942 --> 00:26:52.947
Hopefully not his cell-mate.


00:26:58.449 --> 00:27:00.750
It's gotta be five miles by now.


00:27:00.752 --> 00:27:03.019
Ah, man. I'd kill for a mojito.


00:27:03.421 --> 00:27:05.122
And a cheeseburger.


00:27:06.424 --> 00:27:08.425
Where the hell is this road?


00:27:08.927 --> 00:27:11.795
Baby, you could get drunk
off my sweat right now.


00:27:12.497 --> 00:27:13.897
You wanna stop?


00:27:14.499 --> 00:27:16.233
Only if you do.


00:27:16.935 --> 00:27:18.434
Yeah, I can stop.


00:27:18.436 --> 00:27:22.141
Ah, Hey! Guys. Annie needs
to take a break.


00:27:25.243 --> 00:27:27.143
What is that?


00:27:27.145 --> 00:27:29.612
Not what. Who?


00:27:51.501 --> 00:27:53.540
What the fuck?


00:27:57.342 --> 00:27:59.308
No shit.


00:27:59.310 --> 00:28:00.981
What do you think happened?


00:28:05.183 --> 00:28:06.115
Be careful.


00:28:06.117 --> 00:28:07.485
Because why?


00:28:09.287 --> 00:28:11.354
No ID's.


00:28:11.356 --> 00:28:12.922
He looks like a gangster.


00:28:12.924 --> 00:28:14.056
Or a Fed.


00:28:14.058 --> 00:28:15.858
Looks like someone left in a hurry.


00:28:16.060 --> 00:28:17.994
Yeah... wouldn't you?


00:28:17.996 --> 00:28:21.464
Ok, guys.
This is too fucked up.


00:28:21.566 --> 00:28:23.500
This is just too fucked up.


00:28:24.402 --> 00:28:27.236
You think he has something to do
with the dead woman in your trunk?


00:28:27.438 --> 00:28:29.605
Oh, yeah, what,
she's a murderer too?


00:28:29.607 --> 00:28:31.440
No, no, no...


00:28:31.442 --> 00:28:35.444
Tyre tracks go the other way.
Long way for her to go.


00:28:35.446 --> 00:28:37.847
Gut-shot and naked in the cold night.


00:28:38.149 --> 00:28:40.216
Looks like someone came a
long way for something.


00:28:40.218 --> 00:28:41.818
Or someone.


00:28:41.920 --> 00:28:43.720
Oh, great.


00:28:44.122 --> 00:28:46.255
So in this entire hell of a place,


00:28:46.257 --> 00:28:49.378
we look for one person to help us
and we keep finding the dead ones.


00:28:50.427 --> 00:28:53.498
And today of all days.


00:28:55.400 --> 00:28:57.333
Do you think we should do
something with the body?


00:28:57.335 --> 00:28:59.702
No, no, no. Fuck him.


00:29:00.004 --> 00:29:02.772
I say we forget we even saw him.


00:29:02.874 --> 00:29:04.855
We have enough
problems of our own.


00:29:06.877 --> 00:29:10.713
Look, you think that maybe we
can stop for a rest now, Roy?


00:29:10.715 --> 00:29:12.315
No, no, no.
We should keep walking.


00:29:13.017 --> 00:29:17.420
The woman needs to take a break,
for Christ's sake.


00:29:18.022 --> 00:29:19.690
Look, give me the bag.


00:29:21.092 --> 00:29:24.763
- You fucking kidding?
- Here's your damn bag.


00:29:27.265 --> 00:29:28.332
Fucker.


00:29:30.034 --> 00:29:33.103
Annie, come on.
Let's get the fuck out of here.


00:29:34.005 --> 00:29:36.673
You know I think you might
need a rest too.


00:29:37.475 --> 00:29:39.876
They're crashing.
It'll be hard to get them...


00:29:39.877 --> 00:29:43.577
Then you should care about whoever
made those tyre tracks coming back.


00:29:53.591 --> 00:29:54.758
Come on.


00:30:14.611 --> 00:30:16.679
- Whoa, whoa, wait.
- I need to stop.


00:30:20.283 --> 00:30:21.918
We should never have come.


00:30:22.520 --> 00:30:24.755
Nobody was coming
along that road.


00:30:26.257 --> 00:30:27.858
I mean the whole trip.


00:30:29.560 --> 00:30:31.396
Yeah, it was your idea.


00:30:33.398 --> 00:30:35.831
I'm not saying it wasn't.
I'm saying we shouldn't have.


00:30:35.833 --> 00:30:38.003
Yeah, well we did,
so that's that.


00:30:41.005 --> 00:30:42.239
Hey.


00:30:43.241 --> 00:30:44.774
You wanna partake?


00:30:45.376 --> 00:30:46.843
Yeah.


00:30:54.117 --> 00:30:55.020
What?


00:30:57.622 --> 00:30:58.721
I didn't say a word.


00:30:58.723 --> 00:31:00.557
Your face said enough.


00:31:01.559 --> 00:31:03.359
What do you want from me, Roy?


00:31:03.761 --> 00:31:06.764
I know what you're thinking.


00:31:08.166 --> 00:31:11.268
Trust me. You have no idea.


00:31:12.370 --> 00:31:15.938
I'm tired, I'm hot, and I'm
fucking sore.


00:31:15.940 --> 00:31:17.040
Is that what you wanna hear?


00:31:18.142 --> 00:31:19.942
Huh? Is it?


00:31:20.144 --> 00:31:23.512
Come on, guys. Billy's right.
Let's just stay cool.


00:31:23.714 --> 00:31:28.518
No, you know what.
You especially should hear this.


00:31:29.620 --> 00:31:31.353
People aren't always as they appear.


00:31:31.355 --> 00:31:32.721
Girl like you should learn that.


00:31:32.723 --> 00:31:33.722
Here it comes.


00:31:33.724 --> 00:31:36.592
Think that tough guy act
gets me hot?


00:31:36.594 --> 00:31:38.527
Isn't that why you wrote me
in the first place?


00:31:38.529 --> 00:31:40.496
I wrote you because of my church.


00:31:40.498 --> 00:31:42.364
- Oh please.
- You got off on it.


00:31:42.366 --> 00:31:45.703
Yeah, because writing to
degenerates is so sexy.


00:31:47.305 --> 00:31:50.207
So I'm a degenerate now? Huh?


00:31:51.509 --> 00:31:53.776
Whoa! Ok...


00:31:57.814 --> 00:32:03.682
This is all very..
very entertaining but...


00:32:04.087 --> 00:32:05.822
what the hell are you guys
talking about?


00:32:06.124 --> 00:32:10.260
That's right, you don't know
how we actually met, do you?


00:32:11.062 --> 00:32:16.232
Let me tell you. Jamie here was
slumming it, getting her jollies


00:32:16.334 --> 00:32:20.837
writing to cons, trying
to save a few souls.


00:32:21.339 --> 00:32:24.941
No way. Haha!


00:32:25.743 --> 00:32:27.309
It wasn't like that.


00:32:27.311 --> 00:32:29.177
I was just some punk ass
drug dealer


00:32:29.179 --> 00:32:30.746
you could take home like a stray.


00:32:30.748 --> 00:32:32.481
You made me believe you
wanted to change.


00:32:32.583 --> 00:32:35.952
Don't kid yourself!
You believe what you want to!


00:32:36.154 --> 00:32:38.157
Billy, did you know any of this?


00:32:41.159 --> 00:32:41.959
Look...


00:32:43.561 --> 00:32:46.395
Lizzy didn't sell me these, ok...


00:32:46.597 --> 00:32:47.865
Roy did.


00:32:49.567 --> 00:32:51.134
No shit?


00:32:52.136 --> 00:32:54.037
Sorry, bro. Jig was up.


00:32:54.639 --> 00:32:57.539
If I'd have known you were a pro
I'd have tried to haggle you more.


00:32:57.541 --> 00:32:58.741
Fuck it.


00:32:59.443 --> 00:33:01.112
Why would you do that?


00:33:03.414 --> 00:33:07.983
I am tired of you paying for everything.


00:33:07.985 --> 00:33:10.152
You know you can't
control me like that any more.


00:33:10.154 --> 00:33:13.822
That's not the way it is!
Money doesn't mean anything to me.


00:33:13.824 --> 00:33:15.891
Of course! Easy for you to
say from where you're at.


00:33:15.893 --> 00:33:20.362
Sure. Because a drive to LA
sounds like so much fun!


00:33:20.364 --> 00:33:21.963
You said you wanted to see
the countryside with me.


00:33:21.965 --> 00:33:23.265
Yup, you, that's it.


00:33:23.267 --> 00:33:25.567
Had nothing to do with me not
wanting to shove that


00:33:25.569 --> 00:33:28.804
damn baggie up my ass to go
through airport security.


00:33:28.806 --> 00:33:31.340
Jamie, wake up!


00:33:31.342 --> 00:33:33.977
I had to break parole just to
even get here.


00:33:35.102 --> 00:33:35.978
What?!


00:33:36.679 --> 00:33:39.082
Why do you think I wanted
that woman buried too?


00:33:39.584 --> 00:33:43.152
Like I want cops sniffing around.
You know, gimme a break!


00:33:43.154 --> 00:33:45.621
You think all the problems
of the world just gonna


00:33:45.623 --> 00:33:48.090
go away because
you want them to?


00:33:48.092 --> 00:33:49.725
Why didn't you just tell me
the truth?


00:33:49.727 --> 00:33:51.960
You don't want the truth.


00:33:51.962 --> 00:33:53.461
I fell in love with you-


00:33:53.463 --> 00:33:55.230
No, you fell in love with saving me!


00:33:59.402 --> 00:34:01.571
Guess I failed at both of
those things.


00:34:02.173 --> 00:34:03.940
Yeah, well, I guess so too.


00:34:04.342 --> 00:34:05.808
You know what?


00:34:05.810 --> 00:34:07.710
I know you cheated on me!


00:34:08.412 --> 00:34:09.378
Oh fuck.


00:34:09.880 --> 00:34:10.846
What?


00:34:10.848 --> 00:34:13.683
I know what you did with Shelly.


00:34:14.685 --> 00:34:15.884
I don't know what you're
talking about.


00:34:15.886 --> 00:34:16.486
Don't!


00:34:26.931 --> 00:34:28.864
Jamie, it didn't mean anything.


00:34:28.866 --> 00:34:30.669
Don't you fucking dare!


00:34:33.471 --> 00:34:35.405
Men are pigs, Annie!


00:34:36.207 --> 00:34:37.741
Better you know that now.


00:34:38.943 --> 00:34:40.412
Oink, oink.


00:34:43.814 --> 00:34:47.082
Oh, come on. That's was
..that was pretty fucking funny.


00:34:47.084 --> 00:34:49.685
Look. I'm sorry, Jamie.


00:34:49.687 --> 00:34:52.523
If you got shit on doesn't mean
it's gonna happen to me.


00:34:54.925 --> 00:34:55.625
Really?


00:34:59.263 --> 00:35:00.964
You think this
one's any different?


00:35:01.966 --> 00:35:04.603
Look, you're not going there.


00:35:07.505 --> 00:35:09.205
Not on my wedding day.


00:35:17.281 --> 00:35:18.649
Come on...


00:35:20.351 --> 00:35:22.552
You can't judge
everybody like that.


00:35:23.354 --> 00:35:24.553
I'm not.


00:35:24.955 --> 00:35:28.557
If you listened, you'd know I'm
not talking about her.


00:35:28.759 --> 00:35:31.827
Who, Billy?
Come on, he's just all talk.


00:35:32.029 --> 00:35:33.997
I'm not talking about them!


00:35:34.699 --> 00:35:36.164
Ok, listen Jamie, I can expl...


00:35:36.166 --> 00:35:37.533
Don't touch me.


00:35:42.339 --> 00:35:47.776
I was so mad at you. I was so
mad at you I just wanted to


00:35:47.778 --> 00:35:50.514
hurt you like you hurt me.


00:35:52.316 --> 00:35:54.852
I hooked up with Billy last night.


00:35:56.554 --> 00:35:57.553
What?


00:35:57.755 --> 00:35:59.656
In the bathroom.


00:36:00.758 --> 00:36:03.193
You were probably off somewhere
selling your drugs.


00:36:04.395 --> 00:36:06.295
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
What the fuck!?


00:36:06.297 --> 00:36:07.966
At least he doesn't hide
who he is.


00:36:10.468 --> 00:36:12.335
Fine! You know what, go!


00:36:13.637 --> 00:36:15.371
Get back here and let's talk!


00:36:15.773 --> 00:36:16.753
Screw you!


00:36:25.082 --> 00:36:27.451
You know some people just
shouldn't be married.


00:36:28.853 --> 00:36:29.952
What do you mean?


00:36:29.954 --> 00:36:31.287
Think about it.


00:36:31.789 --> 00:36:36.494
You think Roy thought she'd turn
out to be such a nut job?


00:36:38.596 --> 00:36:40.029
Well, I'm not like that.


00:36:40.831 --> 00:36:44.036
Well, I dunno.
How can I be so sure?


00:36:47.438 --> 00:36:49.638
I'm as crazy as you want me to be.


00:37:02.787 --> 00:37:03.919
Oh...


00:37:03.921 --> 00:37:05.887
You are a bad girl.


00:37:06.990 --> 00:37:08.757
If that's what you want.


00:37:24.974 --> 00:37:26.742
Ooooh...


00:37:29.446 --> 00:37:31.648
Seems like someone's joined us.


00:37:32.750 --> 00:37:34.583
You're damn straight.


00:37:34.985 --> 00:37:37.222
I don't need a pill for that, Baby.


00:37:40.424 --> 00:37:42.491
And you never will when
you're with me.


00:38:06.683 --> 00:38:07.784
Billy!?


00:38:08.786 --> 00:38:10.187
He ain't here.


00:38:11.789 --> 00:38:12.722
Hello.


00:38:13.924 --> 00:38:15.357
What do you mean he isn't here?


00:38:15.559 --> 00:38:17.828
I mean what I say.
He ain't around.


00:38:19.530 --> 00:38:21.231
How long have you been there?


00:38:22.733 --> 00:38:23.804
Long enough.


00:38:28.906 --> 00:38:31.106
Easy, easy.
Don't be so damn jumpy.


00:38:31.108 --> 00:38:32.508
You just scared me.


00:38:32.610 --> 00:38:34.077
Not my intention.


00:38:35.779 --> 00:38:36.679
Billy!


00:38:43.187 --> 00:38:44.555
Where's Jamie?


00:38:47.057 --> 00:38:48.257
Screw her.


00:38:48.659 --> 00:38:50.726
Roy. Where's your wife?


00:38:51.661 --> 00:38:53.028
Gone.


00:38:58.034 --> 00:39:02.740
Gone, sayonara, vamoose.
And you what?


00:39:04.942 --> 00:39:06.709
It's all good with me.


00:39:14.751 --> 00:39:15.919
Billy!


00:39:17.121 --> 00:39:18.154
Billy!


00:39:18.656 --> 00:39:19.221
Bill...


00:39:19.223 --> 00:39:20.222
Jesus.


00:39:20.824 --> 00:39:21.757
What?


00:39:21.759 --> 00:39:22.759
Billy...


00:39:23.561 --> 00:39:24.726
I thought you left.


00:39:24.728 --> 00:39:28.163
Where the hell would I go?
I was taking a piss.


00:39:28.165 --> 00:39:29.598
Jamie's gone.


00:39:30.000 --> 00:39:31.199
What?


00:39:31.201 --> 00:39:32.936
He said she just took off.


00:39:34.038 --> 00:39:37.039
Whattaya mean? She just
can't 'take off' out here!


00:39:37.041 --> 00:39:40.042
Said she had enough and, she left.


00:39:40.544 --> 00:39:45.511
Left me, left you,
left this marriage.


00:39:47.750 --> 00:39:48.817
Good riddance.


00:39:48.819 --> 00:39:51.019
She can't be out there alone.


00:39:51.021 --> 00:39:53.056
You're worried about safe now?


00:39:53.958 --> 00:39:54.791
Or...


00:39:55.893 --> 00:39:58.430
maybe you want her back
for your own reasons.


00:40:01.706 --> 00:40:02.706
What is that supposed to mean?


00:40:02.732 --> 00:40:03.865
You know exactly what that means.


00:40:03.867 --> 00:40:06.872
No, Roy. I don't know
exactly what that means.


00:40:10.774 --> 00:40:12.274
We gotta go find her.


00:40:12.576 --> 00:40:14.209
If you think so, but...


00:40:14.211 --> 00:40:16.044
I think that we should split up.


00:40:16.046 --> 00:40:17.713
She couldn't have got far.


00:40:18.215 --> 00:40:19.715
Knock yourselves out.


00:40:19.717 --> 00:40:20.916
Just get your ass up!


00:40:20.918 --> 00:40:23.784
When the fuck did you find a
conscience?


00:40:26.889 --> 00:40:29.949
I don't remember you having one
when you killed that woman.


00:40:35.965 --> 00:40:40.269
Well, couple of bruises and
you turn into Mr. Sunshine, huh?


00:40:40.671 --> 00:40:43.838
Well that's me, baby.
Personality plus.


00:40:47.010 --> 00:40:49.646
She obviously hasn't come
by us, right. So...


00:40:50.848 --> 00:40:53.949
Why don't you head off there.
I'll head off over there.


00:40:53.951 --> 00:40:56.753
If you see her, if you see
anything, Just yell.


00:40:58.355 --> 00:41:00.758
Don't you think we should
just stay together?


00:41:03.360 --> 00:41:06.728
Baby, it's better if we
split up, all right.


00:41:06.730 --> 00:41:08.630
We don't know which way she went.


00:41:08.732 --> 00:41:10.866
Look, just go for ten minutes.


00:41:10.868 --> 00:41:12.468
If you can't find her then come back.


00:41:12.670 --> 00:41:14.569
All right, well just promise
that you're gonna stay close.


00:41:14.571 --> 00:41:17.074
Because I don't want to be
around him when he's like this.


00:41:18.976 --> 00:41:23.212
It's fine, Baby. He's just
pissed because Jamie dumped him.


00:41:23.614 --> 00:41:25.015
I can hear you.


00:41:26.617 --> 00:41:27.816
Ok, well good.


00:41:27.918 --> 00:41:30.752
Then maybe you'll stop creeping
out my fiance.


00:41:30.854 --> 00:41:33.256
Ooo, fiance.


00:41:34.658 --> 00:41:36.861
All right, Baby, go.
Just be careful.


00:41:39.363 --> 00:41:40.530
Fine.


00:41:48.938 --> 00:41:52.107
You know, you're a real
dickhead when you're high.


00:41:53.943 --> 00:41:57.311
Ah, blow me. Ha.


00:41:58.347 --> 00:42:00.015
Blow me.


00:42:05.955 --> 00:42:06.888
Jamie!


00:42:06.890 --> 00:42:07.857
Jamie!


00:42:13.996 --> 00:42:15.364
Jamie!


00:42:15.766 --> 00:42:18.168
Jamie!


00:42:19.670 --> 00:42:21.437
Jamie!


00:42:22.439 --> 00:42:24.340
BILLY!


00:42:24.942 --> 00:42:27.008
Billy! Come Quick!


00:42:32.081 --> 00:42:34.082
Annie, what!? What the fuck!?


00:42:34.084 --> 00:42:35.450
She's dead!


00:42:35.452 --> 00:42:36.218
What!?


00:42:36.220 --> 00:42:37.655
She's dead!


00:42:39.757 --> 00:42:41.356
Fuck. What happened?


00:42:41.358 --> 00:42:44.859
I just saw her lying here
and thought she just passed out.


00:42:44.861 --> 00:42:46.829
Then when I got closer
I saw all the blood.


00:42:47.831 --> 00:42:49.215
Jesus Christ!


00:42:57.941 --> 00:42:59.944
Jesus Christ!


00:43:02.946 --> 00:43:04.045
It's gonna be okay.


00:43:04.047 --> 00:43:05.080
Jamie?


00:43:05.182 --> 00:43:06.582
No, it won't.


00:43:06.884 --> 00:43:07.850
Jamie...


00:43:22.799 --> 00:43:24.467
I'm so sorry.


00:43:25.169 --> 00:43:26.670
Why'd you have to kill her?


00:43:28.872 --> 00:43:30.072
What?


00:43:31.240 --> 00:43:32.440
She's my wife?


00:43:32.442 --> 00:43:33.742
She was your wife.


00:43:33.744 --> 00:43:35.143
Shut the hell up!


00:43:35.145 --> 00:43:36.912
Annie, just leave it.


00:43:46.889 --> 00:43:49.191
Whoever killed that man
must've been back.


00:43:49.393 --> 00:43:51.159
Roy, I didn't see a car.


00:43:51.161 --> 00:43:52.896
That doesn't matter, Billy!


00:43:54.398 --> 00:43:56.801
She said that he used to hit her.


00:44:00.103 --> 00:44:01.136
That's bullshit.


00:44:01.138 --> 00:44:02.504
Then why would she say it?


00:44:02.506 --> 00:44:05.040
She was upset with me
because of something I did.


00:44:05.342 --> 00:44:08.822
That's why she slept with your
man last night!


00:44:09.979 --> 00:44:12.247
Whoa, whoa... No, no, no...


00:44:12.349 --> 00:44:14.482
Don't be dragging me into this shit.


00:44:14.484 --> 00:44:17.104
That didn't happen.
Billy was with me last night.


00:44:19.422 --> 00:44:22.424
She got you jealous so you
killed her.


00:44:23.126 --> 00:44:24.492
Why are you saying this?


00:44:24.494 --> 00:44:26.094
Whoa! Whoa!


00:44:26.496 --> 00:44:28.397
Roy. Both of you.


00:44:28.899 --> 00:44:30.768
Just calm the hell down.


00:44:33.370 --> 00:44:36.672
Listen...
I didn't kill my wife.


00:44:37.074 --> 00:44:40.408
At the very least,
she fell and hit her head.


00:44:40.410 --> 00:44:43.611
Look at her head, you fucking psycho!
It's bashed in!


00:44:43.613 --> 00:44:44.780
Hey you know what, just...


00:44:45.582 --> 00:44:47.048
We'll get the cops out here,


00:44:47.050 --> 00:44:48.852
and we'll let them figure it out.


00:44:50.254 --> 00:44:51.955
You think I did it too?


00:44:53.457 --> 00:44:56.392
That is for the cops to say.


00:44:57.194 --> 00:44:58.960
There's no cops out here, Billy!


00:44:58.962 --> 00:45:03.498
You need to chill the
fuck out, Roy.


00:45:03.500 --> 00:45:04.567
A gun?


00:45:05.369 --> 00:45:09.371
Let's call it my little
security blanket, ok?


00:45:09.573 --> 00:45:10.774
Whattaya gonna do?


00:45:12.276 --> 00:45:13.541
Shoot me now?


00:45:13.543 --> 00:45:17.215
I don't wanna shoot anyone.
Ok, but I will if I have to.


00:45:20.517 --> 00:45:22.819
I can't convince you two I'm
innocent...


00:45:24.221 --> 00:45:26.423
what hope do I have
with any cops.


00:45:27.925 --> 00:45:30.425
If you didn't do it, then
everything's fine.


00:45:30.427 --> 00:45:33.495
They have CSI guys that can
figure this shit out.


00:45:33.997 --> 00:45:38.097
Doesn't work that way when
you have a record like mine.


00:46:04.661 --> 00:46:06.045
I'm so sorry.


00:46:14.571 --> 00:46:15.804
I gotta go.


00:46:16.406 --> 00:46:17.939
You're leaving because
you're guilty.


00:46:17.941 --> 00:46:21.478
I'm leaving because I'm innocent.
Ok?


00:46:23.480 --> 00:46:26.181
We can't just let him go.
Do something.


00:46:26.183 --> 00:46:28.350
Roy, if you didn't do this


00:46:28.352 --> 00:46:32.054
then I think we should all just
stick together. Right?


00:46:32.356 --> 00:46:34.190
I'll take my chances.


00:46:34.992 --> 00:46:37.629
Roy, I'll fucking shoot you.


00:46:41.231 --> 00:46:43.068
I'm not stopping you.


00:46:46.470 --> 00:46:47.638
Roy!


00:46:50.240 --> 00:46:51.907
Fuck...


00:47:05.688 --> 00:47:08.324
Annie, I couldn't just
shoot him in the back.


00:47:09.726 --> 00:47:12.328
It's okay. It's okay.


00:47:13.430 --> 00:47:16.598
Probably better off that
he's gone anyway, right?


00:47:16.700 --> 00:47:18.934
I mean, what if he
didn't kill her?


00:47:19.036 --> 00:47:21.670
He answered that when he ran away.


00:47:22.072 --> 00:47:27.640
Shit. You know what,
I'm not... I'm not thinking straight.


00:47:28.010 --> 00:47:32.079
All the drugs and the booze.
You know, I'd have...


00:47:32.248 --> 00:47:34.682
I'd have fucking killed him if I
had to, though.


00:47:34.684 --> 00:47:36.451
It's okay. He's gone.


00:47:38.054 --> 00:47:42.692
You scared him off. Saved us.
You did.


00:47:44.494 --> 00:47:46.061
Yeah.


00:47:47.430 --> 00:47:49.133
We gotta move out.


00:47:52.235 --> 00:47:53.636
What about Jamie?


00:47:55.038 --> 00:47:57.505
What about her? What, do
you want to take her with us?


00:47:57.507 --> 00:47:59.407
We can't leave her here like this?


00:47:59.409 --> 00:48:01.009
Like what - dead?


00:48:01.111 --> 00:48:03.678
Sprawled out - food for
whatever lives out here.


00:48:03.680 --> 00:48:05.648
I don't think she's gonna
give a shit.


00:48:06.650 --> 00:48:09.618
We don't know how long it's gonna
be until we can get back here.


00:48:10.420 --> 00:48:12.758
It's just like that
woman at your car.


00:48:17.360 --> 00:48:18.727
All right, fine.


00:48:39.482 --> 00:48:41.851
Do you think we should go
back to the car?


00:48:43.753 --> 00:48:48.623
You know what? We never should've listened
to Roy in the first place and left the car.


00:48:48.825 --> 00:48:50.993
Probably all part of his plan.


00:48:51.695 --> 00:48:53.328
Makes sense.


00:48:53.730 --> 00:48:57.600
Yeah... Well he better not
come around here again.


00:48:58.702 --> 00:49:00.638
No more Mr. Nice guy.


00:49:03.640 --> 00:49:05.742
You hear that, Psycho!


00:49:07.644 --> 00:49:09.711
Come on. Let's go.


00:49:28.697 --> 00:49:30.765
Sorry, Jamie.


00:49:41.811 --> 00:49:43.945
- Hey. Hey.
- You wanna stop?


00:49:44.147 --> 00:49:45.113
I'm okay.


00:49:45.315 --> 00:49:48.483
Are you sure? I mean, we
can take a break if you want.


00:49:48.485 --> 00:49:49.651
No, I'll be all right.


00:49:49.853 --> 00:49:51.586
Just give me a second.


00:49:51.588 --> 00:49:53.789
Look! Water!


00:49:54.591 --> 00:49:56.057
It's probably a mirage.


00:49:56.059 --> 00:49:57.759
No, it might be water!


00:49:58.361 --> 00:50:02.064
Sure it is. Bet that's
where they bottle my Evian.


00:50:02.766 --> 00:50:04.182
Jesus. Fuck!


00:50:11.174 --> 00:50:14.844
Yeah, sure.
Thousand years ago, maybe.


00:50:16.146 --> 00:50:17.581
Shut up.


00:50:20.483 --> 00:50:21.850
I hate this place.


00:50:52.414 --> 00:50:53.148
Ohh...


00:50:53.750 --> 00:50:54.884
You okay?


00:50:56.786 --> 00:50:58.388
We gotta stop.


00:51:00.590 --> 00:51:02.223
We can't be too far now.


00:51:02.225 --> 00:51:05.592
Annie, it could be two feet.
We still gotta stop.


00:51:14.303 --> 00:51:15.870
You're still gonna protect me, right?


00:51:15.872 --> 00:51:19.208
Sweetie, from here on out
it is every man for himself.


00:51:20.810 --> 00:51:22.044
Ok...


00:51:22.646 --> 00:51:27.716
Wait. Look, none of this shit
would've happened to me before.


00:51:28.618 --> 00:51:31.718
I need to get back and
straighten everything out.


00:51:39.663 --> 00:51:40.863
What is it, Billy?


00:51:41.665 --> 00:51:42.731
Nothing.


00:51:43.833 --> 00:51:45.904
Nothing, let's
just keep moving.


00:51:49.706 --> 00:51:52.006
Jesus. Look at this place.


00:52:10.994 --> 00:52:13.428
Maybe we should check in
that little baggie again.


00:52:13.530 --> 00:52:14.996
There's no vicodin left.


00:52:14.998 --> 00:52:16.597
What about the percocets?


00:52:16.599 --> 00:52:17.799
That's gone too.


00:52:18.001 --> 00:52:20.668
You ate all the percocets?
Well, what's left in the bag?


00:52:20.670 --> 00:52:25.472
I dunno, Annie! Nothing that's going
to help us out here, I'm sure!


00:52:25.474 --> 00:52:29.313
Look, I'm sorry.
I was just trying to help.


00:52:32.515 --> 00:52:35.787
I know. I'm sorry.


00:52:39.289 --> 00:52:41.489
Look, how much do you
know about me?


00:52:41.791 --> 00:52:42.891
Whattaya mean?


00:52:43.593 --> 00:52:46.561
You obviously googled me
before the audition, right?


00:52:47.063 --> 00:52:49.431
Um, yeah.
A little bit, I guess.


00:52:50.033 --> 00:52:51.700
So, how much do you know?


00:52:52.802 --> 00:52:55.903
I know that you're a big success.


00:52:55.905 --> 00:52:56.704
And...


00:52:57.006 --> 00:52:59.708
You are hot as hell.


00:53:01.010 --> 00:53:02.915
So you know what
happened to me then?


00:53:07.717 --> 00:53:12.089
I've been sober five years,
four months, two days.


00:53:14.491 --> 00:53:16.827
There was a chick I used
to hang out with...


00:53:19.929 --> 00:53:21.798
No, she wasn't some chick.


00:53:23.400 --> 00:53:26.603
Her name was Angie
and I loved her. A lot.


00:53:28.905 --> 00:53:31.875
But she OD'd, on a bad batch.


00:53:33.877 --> 00:53:35.977
I woke up with a
plunger in my arm.


00:53:35.979 --> 00:53:40.950
I'd managed to plunge hers but I
passed out before I did my own.


00:53:42.752 --> 00:53:44.420
They said I killed her.


00:53:45.422 --> 00:53:49.502
Cops wanted to charge me, but,
my lawyers convinced the court that


00:53:50.926 --> 00:53:54.594
I was smart and rich enough
to clean up on my own.


00:53:59.802 --> 00:54:04.374
I've missed that woman everyday
since the day she died.


00:54:06.876 --> 00:54:10.612
But I've been sober since.
Just me against the world.


00:54:11.714 --> 00:54:13.114
Until last night.


00:54:20.023 --> 00:54:20.991
Well...


00:54:23.493 --> 00:54:24.960
you're not alone anymore.


00:54:28.697 --> 00:54:30.735
And we don't need these to
be happy.


00:54:34.137 --> 00:54:35.837
My little muse, huh?


00:54:44.414 --> 00:54:48.651
Listen, I been thinking, Billy.
And after what you just told me...


00:54:49.953 --> 00:54:53.321
You know there was only one person who
was against us burying that woman.


00:54:53.823 --> 00:54:55.825
And burying all the trouble that
went with her.


00:54:58.027 --> 00:54:59.261
With Jamie...


00:55:00.463 --> 00:55:01.229
gone...


00:55:01.731 --> 00:55:03.398
and if Roy runs...


00:55:03.800 --> 00:55:06.735
We're the ones to deal with the
rap on hitting that woman?


00:55:07.437 --> 00:55:09.504
I mean she ran into our road.


00:55:09.506 --> 00:55:11.006
She shot at us.


00:55:12.008 --> 00:55:14.610
She probably even killed that
man back there.


00:55:15.612 --> 00:55:17.380
That's what I've been
saying all along.


00:55:19.182 --> 00:55:24.382
So you agree that we should
just make it all go away.


00:55:28.892 --> 00:55:30.259
I totally agree.


00:55:32.061 --> 00:55:33.628
Come on. Let's go.


00:56:30.886 --> 00:56:33.421
Oh... Wait... Billy?


00:56:33.523 --> 00:56:35.822
Billy! That's the car!
There's the car!


00:56:35.824 --> 00:56:38.659
We found it! Hahaha!


00:56:38.761 --> 00:56:40.495
I knew I'd find it!


00:56:41.097 --> 00:56:42.597
I never doubted you.


00:56:43.299 --> 00:56:44.300
I...


00:56:45.902 --> 00:56:47.669
AM THE GOLDEN CHILD!!


00:56:48.671 --> 00:56:50.972
Well. At least I don't see Roy.


00:56:51.274 --> 00:56:53.040
Come on. Let's go.
It's shelter.


00:56:53.042 --> 00:56:54.275
Come on.


00:56:54.877 --> 00:56:56.544
Someone kill me.


00:57:06.688 --> 00:57:09.691
I am never walking anywhere
ever again.


00:57:10.593 --> 00:57:11.993
Sounds good to me.


00:57:12.795 --> 00:57:14.128
WHOOOO!


00:57:14.130 --> 00:57:15.663
Careful. That might be hot.


00:57:15.865 --> 00:57:17.132
Fuck.


00:57:24.773 --> 00:57:26.808
Think anybody came past
while we were gone?


00:57:27.910 --> 00:57:29.777
I dunno. You see any tracks?


00:57:37.052 --> 00:57:37.785
No.


00:57:37.987 --> 00:57:39.655
Well then, there's your answer.


00:57:41.357 --> 00:57:43.224
Where do you think Roy is?


00:57:43.726 --> 00:57:45.126
Dead I hope.


00:57:45.928 --> 00:57:47.128
What if he comes back?


00:57:47.130 --> 00:57:48.529
Then I'll shoot him.


00:57:48.731 --> 00:57:49.697
You will?


00:57:50.199 --> 00:57:53.066
Fuck him.
We were here first.


00:58:00.676 --> 00:58:02.143
Eventually it's gonna be dark.


00:58:02.145 --> 00:58:04.979
Which means cars will have
to turn on their headlights.


00:58:05.381 --> 00:58:07.381
We won't be able to see
them from here.


00:58:07.383 --> 00:58:11.055
No, not from here. From there.


00:58:14.157 --> 00:58:15.957
We're getting out of here, Baby.


00:58:16.259 --> 00:58:18.960
But first we gotta deal with
that chick in the trunk.


00:58:19.662 --> 00:58:21.062
Let's start digging.


00:58:32.675 --> 00:58:33.809
Ohhh.


00:58:35.311 --> 00:58:36.278
Fuck.


00:59:03.438 --> 00:59:04.574
Yeah.


00:59:06.876 --> 00:59:08.076
This should work.


00:59:08.978 --> 00:59:12.213
You're damn straight. Huh?
Who's the man?


00:59:12.215 --> 00:59:13.517
You are.


00:59:16.219 --> 00:59:18.053
Damn right, Baby.


00:59:19.155 --> 00:59:22.925
'Cause I am Billy fucking Rich!


00:59:24.327 --> 00:59:25.427
Whooo!


00:59:34.370 --> 00:59:37.272
Wow. Ok.


00:59:37.874 --> 00:59:39.974
Vegas, here we come!


00:59:46.015 --> 00:59:47.216
Oh yeah...


00:59:48.818 --> 00:59:51.488
There's gonna be some
cars coming now, baby.


00:59:54.390 --> 00:59:56.490
There's gonna be some
cars coming now.


01:00:05.067 --> 01:00:07.969
It's not like we're in the
fucking outback?


01:00:08.271 --> 01:00:10.038
Where the hell is every one?


01:00:10.740 --> 01:00:12.142
Someone'll find us.


01:00:15.044 --> 01:00:16.377
Are you hungry?


01:00:17.079 --> 01:00:18.446
Starving.


01:00:18.948 --> 01:00:21.016
Why haven't you said anything
about it?


01:00:22.318 --> 01:00:24.021
I don't like complaining.


01:00:27.323 --> 01:00:29.562
Are you sure you're an actress?


01:00:34.764 --> 01:00:35.764
What was that?


01:00:36.966 --> 01:00:37.967
What?


01:00:39.769 --> 01:00:41.302
You didn't hear that?


01:00:42.104 --> 01:00:43.971
There's no nobody out here.


01:00:54.416 --> 01:00:57.418
Oh shit! Get up. Get up!


01:00:57.420 --> 01:00:59.156
It's Roy. Get up!


01:01:02.258 --> 01:01:03.826
What are you doing here?


01:01:05.928 --> 01:01:08.197
Roy, you don't look so good.


01:01:10.199 --> 01:01:11.466
You gotta help me.


01:01:12.368 --> 01:01:17.271
Why don't you let me see your
hands and I'll think about it.


01:01:17.573 --> 01:01:19.139
I didn't kill my wife.


01:01:19.141 --> 01:01:21.342
Yeah, so you said.


01:01:22.144 --> 01:01:23.511
I loved her.


01:01:23.913 --> 01:01:25.750
You weren't acting like it.


01:01:29.552 --> 01:01:30.951
Why don't you sit down?


01:01:30.953 --> 01:01:32.454
She saved me.


01:01:33.556 --> 01:01:35.389
Saved me from myself.


01:01:35.391 --> 01:01:36.757
He said stop.


01:01:37.159 --> 01:01:38.726
You gotta believe me.


01:01:39.228 --> 01:01:41.696
Don't make me fucking shoot you.


01:01:41.998 --> 01:01:43.364
She was my life.


01:01:43.366 --> 01:01:45.201
Don't make me shoot you, Roy.


01:01:47.403 --> 01:01:50.238
Annie. Annie.


01:01:51.340 --> 01:01:52.640
Annie.


01:01:53.442 --> 01:01:56.380
I was there when you woke up.
Remember?


01:01:59.882 --> 01:02:00.981
Where were you?


01:02:00.983 --> 01:02:02.249
The fuck you talking about?


01:02:02.251 --> 01:02:05.720
You had to shut her up,
didn't you?


01:02:06.322 --> 01:02:10.689
He tell you what he
did to my wife last night?


01:02:15.463 --> 01:02:16.497
Billy?


01:02:17.099 --> 01:02:20.104
This is all your fault.


01:02:23.506 --> 01:02:25.239
Billy. Say something.


01:02:25.241 --> 01:02:28.009
Yeah, Billy. Say something.


01:02:28.311 --> 01:02:30.545
It's not the way he's
putting it, Annie.


01:02:31.447 --> 01:02:33.117
She kissed me!


01:02:36.919 --> 01:02:38.954
Look. We didn't...


01:02:39.956 --> 01:02:41.522
The fuck... it... this...


01:02:41.924 --> 01:02:43.357
it doesn't fucking matter anyways.


01:02:43.359 --> 01:02:45.392
You killed her. I didn't.


01:02:45.394 --> 01:02:47.128
She was gonna tell you, Annie


01:02:47.430 --> 01:02:50.867
but he killed her so
you could never find out.


01:02:53.369 --> 01:02:55.436
Billy, where were you when
I was sleeping?


01:02:56.138 --> 01:02:59.473
I was taking a piss. You know that.
I didn't even see her.


01:02:59.475 --> 01:03:01.744
You got as many
witnesses as me.


01:03:03.946 --> 01:03:05.184
I got the truth.


01:03:10.086 --> 01:03:11.151
The truth?


01:03:11.253 --> 01:03:15.255
Hahaha...


01:03:15.257 --> 01:03:19.425
Is that why you
two buried that woman? Huh?


01:03:20.028 --> 01:03:21.196
The truth?


01:03:24.132 --> 01:03:25.199
Oh yeah.


01:03:27.168 --> 01:03:29.436
I know more than you think.


01:03:33.508 --> 01:03:35.376
But I got a gun.


01:03:35.378 --> 01:03:38.614
So why don't you shut the fuck
up and sit down.


01:03:40.216 --> 01:03:41.784
You know what Billy?


01:03:43.686 --> 01:03:45.721
You ain't got the balls.


01:03:47.423 --> 01:03:49.427
Why don't you try me, Roy?


01:03:53.129 --> 01:03:54.762
Stop! Billy!


01:03:55.064 --> 01:03:56.031
Stop!


01:03:57.233 --> 01:03:58.899
Shoot... Billy!


01:03:59.101 --> 01:04:00.502
BILLY!


01:04:02.204 --> 01:04:03.637
Roy! Stop!


01:04:08.711 --> 01:04:10.311
Ughhh...


01:04:11.313 --> 01:04:12.448
Shit...


01:04:14.050 --> 01:04:15.083
Oh... Ughhh...


01:04:19.621 --> 01:04:21.289
Oh fuck...


01:04:22.391 --> 01:04:23.471
Oh fuck...


01:04:28.297 --> 01:04:29.297
Fuck!


01:04:30.399 --> 01:04:32.566
He went fucking crazy!


01:04:32.668 --> 01:04:35.669
You needed to. You needed to.
You had to.


01:04:35.671 --> 01:04:37.638
He was fucking crazy!


01:04:38.140 --> 01:04:42.144
You had to. To save me.
You did.


01:04:43.446 --> 01:04:46.380
I never killed Jamie.
I never killed anyone... ever.


01:04:46.382 --> 01:04:49.085
Listen to me. I believe you.
Ok? I believe you.


01:04:51.087 --> 01:04:52.786
What he said about last
night, Annie...


01:04:52.788 --> 01:04:53.921
Ssssh.


01:04:54.523 --> 01:04:57.724
It doesn't matter, ok? We all
have a past. I told you that.


01:04:57.726 --> 01:05:00.127
And that's what this is.
This is the past.


01:05:00.329 --> 01:05:02.162
Whatever he said...
look at me...


01:05:02.264 --> 01:05:03.664
it doesn't matter.


01:05:04.166 --> 01:05:08.003
'Cause as long as we're together,
we're gonna be fine.


01:05:09.105 --> 01:05:14.374
We're gonna be fine. Ok?
Ok.


01:05:14.376 --> 01:05:15.744
Look at me. Look at me.


01:05:17.646 --> 01:05:19.013
We're gonna be fine.


01:05:35.363 --> 01:05:38.000
You know, this actually
might work out.


01:05:40.102 --> 01:05:42.137
We know that Roy killed Jamie.


01:05:43.439 --> 01:05:45.607
And we can say that
he was driving too.


01:05:47.209 --> 01:05:49.410
That he went crazy and
attacked us.


01:05:49.812 --> 01:05:53.348
That way we won't have to hide
any more dead bodies out here.


01:05:54.250 --> 01:05:56.552
Billy, what if Roy didn't
kill Jamie?


01:05:58.354 --> 01:06:00.956
What if whoever killed that guy
in the suit came back and did it?


01:06:02.858 --> 01:06:04.726
What if he's watching us now?


01:06:05.728 --> 01:06:07.895
No. There's nobody else out here.


01:06:08.197 --> 01:06:10.165
Baby, it's okay. You're safe.


01:06:11.267 --> 01:06:13.468
Then what if Jamie really did fall?


01:06:14.770 --> 01:06:15.902
You said Roy...


01:06:15.904 --> 01:06:17.605
I said I think Roy did it.


01:06:18.307 --> 01:06:20.141
But you know how the cops are.


01:06:21.343 --> 01:06:23.343
If they prove it was a accident,
we don't want them to be


01:06:23.345 --> 01:06:25.279
suspicious about you shooting Roy.


01:06:25.381 --> 01:06:27.247
And what happens if
they find that woman?


01:06:27.349 --> 01:06:28.849
Roy attacked me.


01:06:28.851 --> 01:06:31.552
And that's exactly what
we'll tell them - if we have to.


01:06:34.656 --> 01:06:36.023
But think about it.


01:06:38.693 --> 01:06:41.228
They're just a couple of
tourists we met last night.


01:06:41.230 --> 01:06:42.797
Who knows what happened
after that?


01:06:45.133 --> 01:06:47.001
Maybe we came out
here on our own.


01:06:48.636 --> 01:06:50.204
I don't know, Annie.


01:06:50.806 --> 01:06:54.446
I don't think that we should push
our luck farther than we gotta.


01:06:56.277 --> 01:06:56.777
Yeah.


01:07:00.749 --> 01:07:04.285
I just can't bear the thought of seeing
you in prison, Billy. It'd kill me.


01:07:05.187 --> 01:07:06.053
What?


01:07:06.355 --> 01:07:08.555
I would do anything for
you to stop that.


01:07:10.558 --> 01:07:11.826
Even this.


01:07:14.229 --> 01:07:15.496
And the way I see it...


01:07:16.864 --> 01:07:19.133
there are tons of dead
bodies out here anyway.


01:07:20.268 --> 01:07:21.636
What's one more?


01:07:28.543 --> 01:07:30.110
Aw, fuck.


01:07:39.554 --> 01:07:41.256
This is the right thing to do.


01:07:42.458 --> 01:07:45.026
I don't want anybody
questioning you about murder.


01:07:45.728 --> 01:07:46.627
Murder?


01:07:46.729 --> 01:07:48.128
Don't even think about it.


01:07:48.130 --> 01:07:49.632
It won't come to that.


01:07:51.734 --> 01:07:53.266
We have too big a future
ahead of us


01:07:53.268 --> 01:07:54.668
to let this get in the way.


01:07:54.770 --> 01:07:56.170
Future?


01:07:56.672 --> 01:07:58.472
I am fucked, Annie.


01:07:58.674 --> 01:07:59.875
I'm done.


01:08:01.777 --> 01:08:04.177
You're not done.
You're the golden boy.


01:08:12.621 --> 01:08:14.690
The studio fired me yesterday.


01:08:16.392 --> 01:08:21.197
That retread of a bitch Lyla had me
replaced with her douchebag boyfriend.


01:08:23.899 --> 01:08:25.567
But it was your show.


01:08:26.669 --> 01:08:28.904
It's always the studio's show.


01:08:30.406 --> 01:08:31.573
What happened?


01:08:32.975 --> 01:08:36.711
A year ago she was back
hostessing at the SaddleRanch.


01:08:37.513 --> 01:08:39.980
Now she has a record deal,
a perfume brand,


01:08:40.082 --> 01:08:44.486
and she's probably flogging a line of
goddamn tampons at Target...


01:08:46.588 --> 01:08:47.754
Now my show.


01:08:47.756 --> 01:08:49.089
Bye bye, baby.


01:08:49.291 --> 01:08:50.824
But her boyfriend?


01:08:51.026 --> 01:08:53.526
It's the Hollywood way, Baby.


01:09:00.736 --> 01:09:02.136
You'll get another one.


01:09:03.038 --> 01:09:04.038
Annie...


01:09:04.840 --> 01:09:06.106
I'm forty.


01:09:07.875 --> 01:09:10.955
That's like a hundred in
Hollywood years, ok.


01:09:11.446 --> 01:09:14.114
If I don't have the mojo to
overrule that bitch...


01:09:18.152 --> 01:09:19.520
Then I got nothing.


01:09:27.962 --> 01:09:29.230
But you know what?


01:09:35.303 --> 01:09:37.171
We don't need that shit town.


01:09:38.807 --> 01:09:42.042
What?
It's a hole. It's a cesspool.


01:09:42.544 --> 01:09:45.846
It'll eat up sweet, innocent
girls like you.


01:09:45.848 --> 01:09:47.382
Look what it did to me?


01:09:48.784 --> 01:09:50.150
We can leave.


01:09:50.452 --> 01:09:52.019
We'll go somewhere free.


01:09:52.821 --> 01:09:56.490
We'll take a chance.
The whole world is open to us.


01:09:57.092 --> 01:09:57.993
Listen.


01:09:59.395 --> 01:10:01.696
I want to give you that white
picket fence,


01:10:02.798 --> 01:10:04.498
and those 2.5 children,


01:10:04.500 --> 01:10:06.466
and those puppies,
and those fireworks,


01:10:06.468 --> 01:10:08.335
and all that apple pie crap.


01:10:09.037 --> 01:10:10.505
You said it yourself.


01:10:11.407 --> 01:10:12.606
We're a team.


01:10:12.908 --> 01:10:16.712
As long as we stick together,
nothing can stop us.


01:10:18.414 --> 01:10:19.580
Yeah...


01:10:19.882 --> 01:10:20.682
Sure.


01:10:26.789 --> 01:10:28.289
Now come on.


01:10:29.091 --> 01:10:31.696
Let's get off
this god damn mountain.


01:10:35.998 --> 01:10:37.464
Annie, come on.


01:10:50.878 --> 01:10:52.012
You know what, baby?


01:10:52.114 --> 01:10:53.513
We'll go to Canada.


01:10:53.715 --> 01:10:55.916
I shot a movie there in '99.


01:10:56.018 --> 01:10:58.418
Those people don't even lock
their doors.


01:10:58.720 --> 01:11:00.053
Don't they live in igloos?


01:11:00.055 --> 01:11:01.822
HaHa. Igloos.


01:11:05.393 --> 01:11:06.661
Shit, baby. Headlights!


01:11:08.930 --> 01:11:10.597
I knew they'd come!


01:11:14.735 --> 01:11:16.303
You know what, you're right.


01:11:17.438 --> 01:11:20.743
You're right, we don't need the
press from this.


01:11:23.545 --> 01:11:24.979
We need to hide the evidence.


01:11:25.581 --> 01:11:26.348
Annie?


01:11:27.950 --> 01:11:28.750
Annie?


01:11:30.752 --> 01:11:32.687
Let's go back to the start.


01:11:33.589 --> 01:11:34.925
How did you meet Billy Rich?


01:11:38.827 --> 01:11:39.927
At the wrap party.


01:11:41.730 --> 01:11:43.797
I didn't even know who
Billy Rich was.


01:11:44.532 --> 01:11:47.493
And he certainly wasn't the type of
person I planned on being around.


01:11:56.878 --> 01:11:59.980
I wanted to leave.
It just wasn't my scene.


01:12:00.182 --> 01:12:01.548
But you didn't.


01:12:03.518 --> 01:12:04.285
No.


01:12:07.121 --> 01:12:08.255
I didn't.


01:12:08.757 --> 01:12:11.724
Billy called me over,
bought me a drink.


01:12:13.494 --> 01:12:16.462
I auditioned for you...
for this show.


01:12:17.498 --> 01:12:19.499
I audition a lot of girls.


01:12:19.801 --> 01:12:20.868
Not like me.


01:12:22.070 --> 01:12:24.137
Well that remains to be seen.


01:12:25.640 --> 01:12:27.760
Wasn't long before I
learned he was Billy Rich.


01:12:28.643 --> 01:12:30.510
Hollywood's prodigal son.


01:12:32.947 --> 01:12:36.549
I mean what harm could come from
letting him buy me a few drinks?


01:12:37.251 --> 01:12:40.819
We drank, talked, laughed.


01:12:43.558 --> 01:12:46.759
It was like I was inside a world I'd
always looked at from the outside.


01:12:51.566 --> 01:12:53.333
It was all so innocent.


01:13:06.847 --> 01:13:08.915
Billy said I was the muse
he always wanted.


01:13:14.055 --> 01:13:17.123
I know I was just wrapped up in
the moment but it was so sweet.


01:13:18.626 --> 01:13:20.294
Like I always imagined.


01:13:22.096 --> 01:13:23.763
I felt like a princess.


01:13:30.972 --> 01:13:32.539
And then it all went to hell.


01:13:35.242 --> 01:13:38.010
That crash. She was dead.


01:13:40.781 --> 01:13:44.101
It was so hot, none of us could
think straight.


01:13:48.055 --> 01:13:49.323
It was horrible.


01:13:50.925 --> 01:13:54.606
Then Billy brought out all this
champagne... and pills.


01:13:56.632 --> 01:13:59.766
But the pain from the accident
was so bad.


01:14:00.068 --> 01:14:01.735
How stupid could I be?


01:14:10.778 --> 01:14:11.845
Are you okay?


01:14:16.283 --> 01:14:17.418
It's nothing.


01:14:18.020 --> 01:14:19.320
Tell me what happened.


01:14:20.322 --> 01:14:21.689
Start with Roy.


01:14:27.928 --> 01:14:30.096
I tried to keep everyone as
calm as I could.


01:14:30.231 --> 01:14:31.765
Just shoot him!


01:14:31.867 --> 01:14:34.601
I pleaded for him to stop.


01:14:34.803 --> 01:14:37.970
If only I had been stronger I could have
stopped it before anyone else got hurt.


01:14:38.038 --> 01:14:38.806
KILL HIM!


01:14:45.379 --> 01:14:46.682
It was horrible.


01:14:49.084 --> 01:14:50.485
Billy shot Roy.


01:14:51.887 --> 01:14:53.590
Shot him right in the chest.


01:14:56.692 --> 01:14:58.527
There was just so much blood.


01:15:00.729 --> 01:15:01.929
And Jamie?


01:15:02.631 --> 01:15:04.532
When things got crazy,
she took off.


01:15:05.934 --> 01:15:06.734
Jamie!


01:15:09.938 --> 01:15:11.938
She was already a mess when
I found her.


01:15:19.247 --> 01:15:21.551
I could have had anybody I wanted.


01:15:25.153 --> 01:15:27.553
And I ended up with Roy.


01:15:34.096 --> 01:15:38.332
Prison broke him,
I know that now.


01:15:39.234 --> 01:15:41.401
Something you might want to think
about if they press charges


01:15:41.403 --> 01:15:43.404
against Billy for killing
that woman.


01:15:44.406 --> 01:15:45.807
What do you mean?


01:15:48.009 --> 01:15:49.577
We can't hide what happened.


01:15:50.979 --> 01:15:52.278
Billy shouldn't have been driving.


01:15:52.280 --> 01:15:53.680
It was an accident.


01:15:53.982 --> 01:15:55.983
Then I guess the authorities
will figure that out.


01:15:56.685 --> 01:15:58.787
I'm not gonna hide the truth, though.


01:16:01.089 --> 01:16:03.423
Billy was driving
and Billy hit her.


01:16:03.425 --> 01:16:06.195
He doesn't seem to show a lot of
remorse about that either.


01:16:08.997 --> 01:16:11.301
Are you sure you know who you're
getting involved with?


01:16:15.203 --> 01:16:16.806
I really wish I had.


01:16:20.308 --> 01:16:22.275
Shut the fuck up, bitch!


01:16:28.115 --> 01:16:29.583
Annie...


01:16:30.185 --> 01:16:31.386
Annie...


01:16:33.388 --> 01:16:35.758
You're not doing this to me.


01:16:38.260 --> 01:16:39.993
I heard her scream...


01:16:39.995 --> 01:16:41.397
and came running.


01:16:43.799 --> 01:16:45.366
My God, it was horrible.


01:16:46.768 --> 01:16:49.436
Billy was rambling about how she
was gonna tell.


01:16:50.038 --> 01:16:53.041
How she wouldn't hide the drunk
driving, hitting that woman.


01:16:54.943 --> 01:16:57.780
He held her face in
the dirt as she kicked.


01:17:00.482 --> 01:17:01.750
Dying.


01:17:04.352 --> 01:17:06.687
The look in Billy's eyes when he
saw me.


01:17:08.089 --> 01:17:13.589
He was cold, emotionless,
like an animal.


01:17:19.134 --> 01:17:20.905
He was against everyone now.


01:17:25.807 --> 01:17:26.973
Billy!


01:17:27.475 --> 01:17:28.909
Then Roy showed up.


01:17:29.511 --> 01:17:31.678
He rushed at Billy...
but Billy had a gun.


01:17:32.480 --> 01:17:34.682
Poor Roy.
There was nothing he could do.


01:17:36.484 --> 01:17:39.419
He herded Roy and me back
towards the car at gun point.


01:17:40.121 --> 01:17:42.357
Rambling. Threatening.


01:17:44.259 --> 01:17:45.960
Roy just couldn't take it anymore.


01:17:47.262 --> 01:17:50.234
The idea of that bastard
killing his wife?


01:17:54.236 --> 01:17:55.771
Roy went after Billy.


01:17:57.973 --> 01:17:59.410
And died for it.


01:18:04.212 --> 01:18:05.512
Bottom line?


01:18:05.914 --> 01:18:07.649
You're lucky to be alive.


01:18:09.851 --> 01:18:11.351
We need to hide the evidence.


01:18:11.353 --> 01:18:13.052
Here. Get rid of that.


01:18:13.154 --> 01:18:14.387
He was slapping me.


01:18:14.389 --> 01:18:16.756
Hitting me so hard I thought I'd
black out.


01:18:17.158 --> 01:18:18.592
He wouldn't stop.


01:18:19.394 --> 01:18:21.128
I knew what was next.


01:18:22.430 --> 01:18:24.230
He gave me no choice.


01:18:31.006 --> 01:18:32.238
Annie, what are you doing?


01:18:32.240 --> 01:18:33.841
You lied to me.


01:18:35.443 --> 01:18:36.976
What are you talking about?


01:18:37.078 --> 01:18:38.879
You said you'd make me a star.


01:18:39.481 --> 01:18:41.447
